{
  "title": "Global Accelerator · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "고정 anycast IP와 AWS 글로벌 네트워크로 지역 엔드포인트까지 트래픽을 유도한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Global Accelerator</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#standard-accelerator\">Standard Accelerator</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#static-ip-addresses\">Static IP Addresses</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#listeners-and-endpoint-groups\">Listeners and Endpoint Groups</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#health-checks-and-failover\">Health Checks and Failover</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#custom-routing-accelerator\">Custom Routing Accelerator</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#global-accelerator-and-cloudfront\">Global Accelerator and CloudFront</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>27 / 62</span></div><h1>Global Accelerator</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Global Accelerator는 고정된 글로벌 진입 주소를 제공하고 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Backbone을 통해 건강한 Regional Endpoint로 트래픽을 전달한다. TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>·UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> Network 경로와 다중 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> Failover에 사용한다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>처럼 콘텐츠 객체를 Cache하는 서비스가 아니다. Client 가까운 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 진입점부터 Regional Endpoint까지의 경로를 최적화하는 기능으로 이해한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"DNS 선택과 연결 Routing 비교\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>DNS 선택과 연결 Routing 비교</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Global Accelerator</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client</strong><small>고정 Anycast IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> global network</strong><small>Healthy Endpoint로 Routing</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Regional endpoints</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a> 등 지원 대상</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>CloudFront</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Viewer</strong><small>HTTP(S) 콘텐츠 요청</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Edge Cache</strong><small>지원 응답 재사용</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Origin</strong><small>Cache Miss 처리</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Global Accelerator는 Cache 서비스가 아니며 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>·UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> Endpoint Routing에 사용한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"standard-accelerator\"><h2>Standard Accelerator<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#standard-accelerator\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a> Endpoint 등에 트래픽을 보낸다. Health 상태에 따라 Endpoint와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>을 선택한다. 주소·Port·Protocol과 해당 Endpoint의 Security 설정을 함께 구성한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"static-ip-addresses\"><h2>Static IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Addresses<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#static-ip-addresses\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Accelerator의 진입 주소를 서비스 동안 유지해 외부 Allowlist와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 운영에 활용한다. Backend IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>가 바뀌어도 Client는 같은 진입 주소를 사용할 수 있다. 주소의 안정성은 Backend 데이터 복제나 세션 보존을 보장하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"listeners-and-endpoint-groups\"><h2>Listeners and Endpoint Groups<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#listeners-and-endpoint-groups\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#listeners-and-target-groups\">Listener</a>는 수신 Protocol과 Port를 정의하고 Endpoint Group은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>별 대상을 묶는다. Endpoint Weight는 Group 안의 분산 비중을, Traffic Dial은 Group의 Traffic 비율을 조절한다. 배포·전환 시 각각의 영향 범위를 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"health-checks-and-failover\"><h2>Health Checks and Failover<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#health-checks-and-failover\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>비정상 대상에 대한 새 트래픽을 줄이고 다른 건강한 Endpoint로 전환한다. 대상 종류에 따라 Health 평가가 다르다. 앱이 Stateful이면 세션 저장과 데이터 복제도 별도로 준비한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"custom-routing-accelerator\"><h2>Custom Routing Accelerator<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#custom-routing-accelerator\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Client를 특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Destination의 특정 Port로 결정적으로 매핑하는 방식이다. 게임 세션처럼 어느 서버의 어느 Port에 연결할지 앱이 정하는 경우에 사용한다. Standard의 Health 기반 Load Balancing과 같은 모델이 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"global-accelerator-and-cloudfront\"><h2>Global Accelerator and CloudFront<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#global-accelerator-and-cloudfront\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>·UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> 글로벌 진입은 Global Accelerator, HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 콘텐츠 Cache는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>를 비교한다. 두 서비스 모두 Global Edge를 사용하지만 목적과 Layer가 다르다. 요구 Protocol·Cache 필요·진입 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 조건을 먼저 확인한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 게임 서버에 UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span>로 연결하고 고정 진입 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>가 필요하면 Global Accelerator를 검토한다. 이미지 Cache가 주목적이면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>가 더 직접적인 선택이다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>콘텐츠 캐싱이 주목적이라면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>를 먼저 검토한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/global-accelerator/latest/dg/what-is-global-accelerator.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">global-accelerator/latest/dg/what-is-global-accelerator.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q025/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q025\" data-question=\"Q025\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q025</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q025/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs fixed IP addresses and optimized routing to healthy TCP endpoints in multiple Regions. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Transfer Acceleration alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront object caching alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Global Accelerator</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a>는 anycast 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 글로벌 네트워크를 활용해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>로 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q033\" data-question=\"Q033\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q033</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q033/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A service requires TCP connections and fixed IP addresses but does not need HTTP path routing. Which load balancer should be considered first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q033\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>는 L4 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>/UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> 연결 요구와 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 요구에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q023\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q024\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q082\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">이전 용어 <b>FSx</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">다음 용어 <b>IAM</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
